WEBVTT

01:47.560 --> 01:48.960
LUMINOL

01:50.040 --> 01:52.800
The restroom is… It's behind you.

01:57.160 --> 01:58.000
Thanks.

03:22.960 --> 03:24.520
HARD-BOILED

04:22.400 --> 04:24.040
STRONG BLEACHING POWDER

06:30.440 --> 06:31.280
Alright.

06:35.280 --> 06:38.120
After Captain Ran passed away,
I went to his house to pack up his things.

06:38.200 --> 06:40.880
In the study,
I found this woodworking box.

06:45.400 --> 06:48.360
I've never opened this box.

06:49.240 --> 06:50.200
After bringing it back,

06:53.280 --> 06:54.120
it's been sealed until now.

07:11.000 --> 07:13.800
OCTAGONAL LAMPSHADE

07:21.880 --> 07:25.880
XU MENG AND DAUGHTER

07:31.560 --> 07:33.320
DRAFT SAVED SUCCESSFULLY

07:33.400 --> 07:35.720
HE YUANHANG

07:35.800 --> 07:37.160
REPORTERS: RAN FANGXU, HE YUANHANG

07:41.520 --> 07:42.480
The names are in the wrong order.

07:43.000 --> 07:45.840
-There's no need for that.
-He, listen to me.

07:45.920 --> 07:46.880
Professionally,

07:46.960 --> 07:49.800
the main credit for solving
this case belongs to you.

07:49.880 --> 07:52.320
And personally, you still have a career
ahead in the criminal department.

07:52.840 --> 07:54.520
I'm about to transfer back to the station.

07:54.600 --> 07:55.600
-Whose name comes first
-Sir…

07:55.680 --> 07:57.200
-doesn't matter.
-Sir.

08:17.800 --> 08:20.160
APPLICATION FOR CRIMINAL DETENTION

08:26.800 --> 08:29.840
On Chinese New Year's Eve,
do you have any plans?

08:30.520 --> 08:32.480
Sir's exact words were,

08:33.039 --> 08:36.000
"As a family, let's have
a reunion dinner together."

08:42.360 --> 08:44.760
APPLICATION FOR CRIMINAL DETENTION

08:51.960 --> 08:58.000
XINGWANG RESTAURANT
YUEDE CITY, GUIZHOU PROVINCE

09:08.600 --> 09:11.320
-Hello? Xingwang Restaurant.
-Hello.

09:11.400 --> 09:13.880
I'm an officer from the Nanshan Branch
of the Weiyang Public Security Bureau.

09:14.480 --> 09:16.720
I'm looking for Qiao Suqing's aunt.

09:17.680 --> 09:18.840
The police?

09:20.040 --> 09:22.440
What… What has Qiao Suqing done now?

09:22.520 --> 09:24.720
I haven't heard from her
in five or six years.

09:25.240 --> 09:29.600
After Qiao Suqing's mother passed away,
you were once her guardian, right?

09:29.680 --> 09:30.560
Officer,

09:32.720 --> 09:34.000
I didn't sell Qing.

09:34.760 --> 09:36.560
I… Let me tell you,

09:36.640 --> 09:39.480
the Yao family was very well-off.

09:39.560 --> 09:42.400
We were only thinking
of finding her a place to stay.

09:42.480 --> 09:44.640
It was to find her a way out.

09:45.160 --> 09:48.960
You have no idea, Officer.
If I hadn't sent Qing away early,

09:49.040 --> 09:51.520
she probably would have
been ruined by her uncle long ago.

09:51.600 --> 09:53.760
I really did it for her own good.

09:55.680 --> 09:56.880
Officer,

09:57.480 --> 09:59.280
let me tell you.

09:59.360 --> 10:03.440
This business about finding
Qing a place to go wasn't my idea.

10:03.520 --> 10:06.680
That year, when she
and her mom went to… Mount Wu.

10:06.760 --> 10:09.240
While they were on a trip there,
her mom told me herself.

10:09.320 --> 10:11.320
Her mom took her there for a blind date.

10:11.400 --> 10:12.920
Don't you see?

10:13.000 --> 10:15.560
If even her own mother
couldn't wait to sell her off,

10:15.640 --> 10:19.160
as her aunt, why couldn't I?

10:50.800 --> 10:53.960
CONTACTS: QIAO

10:58.000 --> 10:59.240
Qiao Suqing.

11:09.960 --> 11:11.400
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH: RELEASE FORM

11:11.480 --> 11:13.400
QIAO SUQING
PROPERTY DETAILS: BAG, MOBILE PHONE

11:13.480 --> 11:16.680
SIGNATURE: QIAO SUQING

11:23.960 --> 11:24.800
Thanks.

11:31.520 --> 11:32.560
WEIYANG PUBLIC
SECURITY BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

11:37.280 --> 11:40.240
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

11:52.920 --> 11:55.160
Qiao Suqing, you are suspected
of intentional homicide.

11:55.240 --> 11:55.920
DETENTION WARRANT

11:56.000 --> 11:57.920
Pursuant to the Criminal Procedure Law
of the PRC,

11:58.000 --> 12:00.640
Article 80, you are hereby
placed under criminal detention.

13:08.080 --> 13:09.240
Don't worry.

13:10.840 --> 13:11.920
Go on.

13:16.440 --> 13:17.560
I'm listening.

13:47.000 --> 13:47.920
Speak up.

13:49.000 --> 13:51.240
How did you kill Xu Meng and her father?

13:54.920 --> 13:55.960
Officer He,

13:57.760 --> 13:59.280
I've already answered this question.

14:00.880 --> 14:03.840
Wu Shanlong killed Xu Meng and her father.
It had nothing to do with me.

14:05.000 --> 14:07.040
No matter how many times
you handcuff me and bring me in,

14:07.880 --> 14:09.280
or how many times you ask,

14:10.240 --> 14:11.440
the answer remains the same.

14:14.840 --> 14:15.920
Tell me,

14:16.840 --> 14:18.600
who is the person in this elevator?

14:23.200 --> 14:26.320
-Aren't they Xu Meng and her father?
-Are they?

14:29.400 --> 14:30.440
This photo

14:31.400 --> 14:32.720
was left behind by Uncle Ran.

14:35.280 --> 14:36.920
He also drew this circle.

14:37.520 --> 14:39.800
Tell me, why did he do that?

14:42.360 --> 14:43.360
I don't know.

15:08.720 --> 15:11.600
Because the person on her back
isn't Xu Zhihong at all.

15:15.120 --> 15:16.040
It's you.

15:23.760 --> 15:26.200
Yuanlongli

15:26.280 --> 15:29.000
Eighteenth floor

15:29.080 --> 15:34.360
Eighteenth floor with 18 pillars

15:34.440 --> 15:40.160
Eighteen pillars with 18 men to carry them

15:40.240 --> 15:43.680
Eighteen bodies, 18 heads

16:07.760 --> 16:09.640
Everything kept here
is evidence of your murders

16:09.720 --> 16:11.880
that Uncle Ran collected back then.

16:12.760 --> 16:15.480
Do I need to take it out
and confront you with it piece by piece?

16:38.440 --> 16:39.760
Is it beautiful?

16:55.720 --> 16:57.240
I killed

16:58.480 --> 16:59.480
Xu Meng and her father.

17:01.360 --> 17:03.520
Wu Shanlong was my accomplice.

17:04.839 --> 17:07.400
We conspired to kill Xu Meng
and her father.

17:08.040 --> 17:10.640
Xu Meng's body was handled by Wu Shanlong.

17:15.200 --> 17:16.720
As for Xu Zhihong's body,

17:17.640 --> 17:19.040
I dismembered it at home.

17:22.160 --> 17:26.240
I put the body parts into different bags,

17:27.000 --> 17:28.800
took them to the garage in batches,

17:30.880 --> 17:33.880
transported them out from there,
and dumped them.

17:35.320 --> 17:37.440
In the end, I accidentally left
an electrician's bag behind,

17:38.280 --> 17:39.880
which was picked up by Qian Dajun.

17:46.320 --> 17:48.200
That's the whole truth.

17:49.960 --> 17:51.000
Officer He,

17:52.040 --> 17:53.480
well done.

17:55.720 --> 17:59.320
Ran always hoped
you would become a police officer,

18:00.960 --> 18:03.400
an excellent criminal investigator.

18:05.200 --> 18:06.360
Looking at you now,

18:09.800 --> 18:11.040
you've already achieved it.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.640
I'm sure his soul in heaven

18:19.440 --> 18:21.160
will also feel comforted.

18:23.920 --> 18:25.000
Qiao Suqing,

18:27.080 --> 18:28.360
you're not worthy of mentioning Uncle Ran.

18:38.480 --> 18:40.440
You've confessed to the murder
of Xu Meng and her father.

18:41.600 --> 18:44.000
Now, let's talk about
your other murder charge.

18:48.640 --> 18:49.880
Who else did I kill?

18:50.480 --> 18:51.480
It couldn't be Yao Baiyuan, could it?

18:52.520 --> 18:53.880
His death was an accident.

18:53.960 --> 18:56.000
It had nothing to do with me.

19:09.040 --> 19:10.840
Xiaohe, a Chinese New Year's gift.

19:10.920 --> 19:13.720
The same style! Thank you, Ms. Qiao.

19:18.440 --> 19:22.040
Xiaohe, I am a murderer,

19:22.880 --> 19:24.440
and I've lied to you for all these years,

19:25.240 --> 19:26.640
but I had my reasons.

19:27.720 --> 19:30.360
There's no deep-seated hatred
between us, right?

19:30.440 --> 19:31.400
Is it necessary for you to cut up

19:31.480 --> 19:33.480
-the things I gave you like this?
-Qiao!

19:36.240 --> 19:38.120
You were the one who killed Uncle Ran.

19:40.840 --> 19:42.520
Are you crazy, He Xiaohe?

19:44.120 --> 19:45.880
Ran died in an accident.

19:46.400 --> 19:48.720
Don't you go making
baseless accusations here!

19:50.560 --> 19:53.520
Just as I thought, you won't confess
until you see the evidence.

20:06.560 --> 20:10.120
JIANGDONG MID ROAD

20:29.040 --> 20:31.360
This is road surveillance from the night
of Chinese New Year's Eve 2003.

20:32.000 --> 20:35.280
This location is less than two kilometers
from where Uncle Ran had his accident.

20:35.920 --> 20:38.200
It was also the only path back to the city
after you finished your part-time job.

20:40.240 --> 20:41.280
Tell me,

20:42.040 --> 20:43.240
why did you appear here?

20:44.400 --> 20:45.840
That's not me.

20:46.440 --> 20:48.880
-That's not me!
-Qiao Suqing, you still want to deny it?

20:50.120 --> 20:51.840
When you went to my house that night,
you were dressed just like this.

20:53.000 --> 20:54.320
No.

20:54.400 --> 20:55.560
No.

20:56.160 --> 20:58.240
After I finished my part-time job,
I left directly by taxi.

20:58.920 --> 21:01.640
I… I never went to this place.

21:03.000 --> 21:04.160
Qiao,

21:04.760 --> 21:06.040
tell me,

21:06.640 --> 21:08.400
who else would be wearing the exact same
clothes as you on Chinese New Year's Eve,

21:08.480 --> 21:09.520
braving the rain,

21:09.600 --> 21:10.920
and running alone
to the vicinity of the crime scene?

21:12.520 --> 21:13.920
Who else, if it wasn't you?

21:15.360 --> 21:16.480
It wasn't me.

21:18.000 --> 21:19.360
Explain this.

21:19.440 --> 21:21.080
Yao Baiyuan fell to his death.

21:21.160 --> 21:22.600
Wu Shanlong fell to his death.

21:22.680 --> 21:23.880
Uncle Ran had a car accident.

21:24.520 --> 21:26.760
There was construction at every scene,
and there was grease at every scene.

21:27.800 --> 21:29.120
How do you explain that?

21:31.560 --> 21:33.760
Did you set the traps in advance

21:36.160 --> 21:38.120
to make it look like
they died in accidents?

21:38.720 --> 21:41.080
Wu Shanlong was. Yao Baiyuan wasn't.

21:42.400 --> 21:43.520
Yao Baiyuan…

21:47.960 --> 21:49.080
Ran…

21:57.360 --> 21:58.320
Liar.

21:58.400 --> 22:00.040
Liar!

22:00.120 --> 22:02.000
I can't believe you lied to me.

22:04.800 --> 22:06.120
What do you mean?

22:10.400 --> 22:11.760
It was her.

22:14.080 --> 22:15.320
It was her.

22:16.400 --> 22:18.360
She was the one who killed Ran.

22:25.440 --> 22:26.400
Who?

22:27.520 --> 22:29.160
Who killed Uncle Ran?

22:38.640 --> 22:39.480
Xu Meng.

22:41.480 --> 22:42.600
It was Xu Meng.

22:44.440 --> 22:45.920
Xu Meng didn't die.

22:48.760 --> 22:50.440
She's been alive all along.

24:24.160 --> 24:25.000
Are you Ms. Qiao?

24:37.280 --> 24:38.920
We're from
the Weiyang Public Security Bureau.

24:39.000 --> 24:40.200
Xu Meng,

24:40.280 --> 24:41.760
you are a suspect in a willful homicide.

24:41.840 --> 24:43.320
In accordance with Article 80
of the Criminal Procedure Law,

24:44.480 --> 24:46.560
you are now under lawful detention.

24:46.640 --> 24:48.080
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH: DETENTION WARRANT

25:08.960 --> 25:11.000
INTERROGATION ROOM RULES AND REGULATIONS

25:13.080 --> 25:14.400
Was she caught?

26:11.240 --> 26:12.520
Qiao Suqing,

26:13.800 --> 26:15.120
now that it's come to this,

26:15.640 --> 26:17.400
can you tell the truth?

26:20.240 --> 26:21.320
Xu Meng and I

26:23.440 --> 26:25.760
met through pen pal correspondence

26:27.040 --> 26:28.640
in the spring of 1995.

26:30.240 --> 26:32.800
The two of us share the same birth date.

26:33.400 --> 26:37.040
At the time, we were listed together
in a pen pal column in a magazine.

26:38.680 --> 26:40.840
She said her mother's surname
was also Qiao.

26:41.840 --> 26:44.120
She was born two hours later than I,

26:45.760 --> 26:47.200
so she called me "sister".

26:48.680 --> 26:51.080
Our family situations
were very similar as well.

26:52.640 --> 26:53.920
She didn't have a mother,

26:54.920 --> 26:56.280
and I didn't have a father.

26:58.000 --> 27:00.760
We both wanted to build
a complete family again.

27:07.240 --> 27:08.200
Qing.

27:08.280 --> 27:09.280
-Yes?
-Want an ice pop?

27:09.360 --> 27:11.040
No, thanks. You have it, Mom.

27:11.120 --> 27:13.040
YOUTH DIGEST

27:13.120 --> 27:14.520
In August that year,

27:15.720 --> 27:17.400
we made a plan

27:17.480 --> 27:19.840
to join a tour group to Mount Wu together.

27:21.000 --> 27:22.960
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

27:24.600 --> 27:26.800
It wasn't just
so the two of us could meet.

27:27.920 --> 27:30.200
It was also actually
to set our parents up.

27:30.280 --> 27:31.720
PEN PAL MATCH: NIHAI PIANXIAN

27:32.320 --> 27:33.440
If it worked out,

27:34.000 --> 27:36.240
we could become a family

27:39.080 --> 27:41.040
and become real sisters.

27:41.680 --> 27:42.520
-Very nice.
-Okay.

27:47.080 --> 27:49.400
Okay. Let's do a roll call.

27:49.480 --> 27:51.240
-Wang Zusheng?
-Here.

27:52.240 --> 27:54.200
-Qiao Suqing?
-Here.

27:56.240 --> 27:57.680
-Fang Xiuhong?
-Present.

27:58.320 --> 28:00.720
-Xu Zhihong?
-Right here.

28:01.240 --> 28:03.640
-Xu Meng?
-Here too.

28:07.480 --> 28:09.680
Everyone, stay close. Watch your step.

28:10.720 --> 28:11.760
Everyone,

28:11.840 --> 28:13.360
right beneath our feet

28:13.440 --> 28:15.760
-It flied away!
-is the famous Mount Wu Slot.

28:15.840 --> 28:18.560
Now, remember when walking
on the suspension bridge,

28:18.640 --> 28:20.880
no running or jumping. Stay safe.

28:20.960 --> 28:22.040
Those in the back, please keep up.

28:31.280 --> 28:32.240
Here.

28:33.360 --> 28:34.560
Wear mine.

28:37.400 --> 28:39.880
Alright, everyone.
We're about to head up the mountain.

28:39.960 --> 28:41.680
Watch your step and stay safe.

28:51.840 --> 28:54.160
Everyone, we must be careful
with our footing.

28:54.240 --> 28:55.960
The path is a bit slippery today.

28:59.960 --> 29:01.040
What's wrong?

29:01.120 --> 29:03.000
-Are you okay?
-Why is the fog so thick?

29:03.080 --> 29:05.320
-I can't even see the road.
-Everyone, don't panic.

29:05.920 --> 29:08.160
This kind of weather
is very common on Mount Wu.

29:08.240 --> 29:09.240
How about this?

29:09.320 --> 29:11.120
Let us all hold hands.

29:13.480 --> 29:15.360
Sister, don't be afraid.

29:15.440 --> 29:16.280
I'm right here with you.

29:21.200 --> 29:22.280
Steady now.

29:22.920 --> 29:23.840
Mom…

29:24.600 --> 29:26.360
I'm having a hard time breathing.

29:26.440 --> 29:27.440
Come and rest here for a bit.

29:28.040 --> 29:29.080
Sit down.

29:32.440 --> 29:34.520
Hey, we really can't stay here.

29:34.600 --> 29:36.320
Once it gets dark, it'll be freezing cold.

29:36.400 --> 29:38.360
What's wrong with waiting a moment?

29:38.440 --> 29:39.760
Can't you be a little considerate?

29:39.840 --> 29:41.520
If you want to die,
don't drag us down with you.

29:41.600 --> 29:43.560
Why do you care about her?
Let's just get moving.

29:43.640 --> 29:44.680
Fine. You guys rest for a while,

29:44.760 --> 29:46.440
-but catch up quickly.
-Hurry up.

29:48.640 --> 29:49.560
-I was unconscious then.
-Qing!

29:51.080 --> 29:53.720
As for what happened later,
I have no idea.

29:55.520 --> 29:56.760
When I woke up,

29:57.280 --> 29:59.040
Xu Meng and her father were gone.

30:00.400 --> 30:02.200
I was completely dazed.

30:02.960 --> 30:05.720
I thought my mom
had accidentally fallen off the cliff.

30:07.240 --> 30:09.240
It felt like in the blink of an eye…

30:11.040 --> 30:12.200
Mom was gone.

30:13.680 --> 30:14.920
My home was gone.

30:17.320 --> 30:18.720
Everything was gone.

30:25.240 --> 30:28.320
When did you run into Xu Meng again?

30:29.040 --> 30:30.640
About half a year later.

30:32.280 --> 30:34.040
When I came to Weiyang back then,

30:36.360 --> 30:38.040
I stayed at Yao Baiyuan's place.

31:09.640 --> 31:10.920
That night,

31:11.960 --> 31:13.640
we talked a lot.

31:14.680 --> 31:15.960
That's when I learned

31:17.160 --> 31:18.960
that after returning from Mount Wu,

31:19.840 --> 31:21.240
her life

31:22.120 --> 31:24.240
wasn't much better than mine.

31:26.120 --> 31:29.520
PEACE AND LUCK TO ALL
WEALTH AND JOY TO HOME

31:30.720 --> 31:32.040
Where's the medicine? Medicine!

31:32.560 --> 31:33.600
Where did you hide the medicine?

31:36.360 --> 31:37.400
Where did you put the medicine?

31:39.280 --> 31:41.680
Medicine! Medicine! Where's the medicine?

31:42.920 --> 31:45.800
It's all your fault
that I've ended up like this!

31:46.400 --> 31:48.680
I need my medicine!

31:49.360 --> 31:50.360
You!

31:51.400 --> 31:52.920
-Dad, please stop hitting me!
-Get me my medicine!

31:53.000 --> 31:54.160
I was wrong, Dad!

31:54.760 --> 31:55.760
-Dad, please stop!
-I need my medicine!

31:55.840 --> 31:57.080
I was wrong, Dad!

31:57.160 --> 31:58.440
-Dad!
-Where is my medine?

31:58.960 --> 32:03.440
QIHUANG CLINIC

32:07.080 --> 32:08.480
Master Zhang,

32:09.280 --> 32:11.360
I'm here for the medicine. Master Zhang?

32:15.920 --> 32:17.160
Master Zhang.

32:20.560 --> 32:22.360
CARE AND VIRTUE, A HEALER'S HEART

32:37.560 --> 32:38.960
Back then,

32:40.280 --> 32:44.520
we were like two elk caught in a snare.

32:44.600 --> 32:46.920
Neither of us could escape,

32:47.000 --> 32:48.240
and neither could help the other.

32:49.240 --> 32:51.400
All we could do
was watch each other in silence.

32:53.760 --> 32:55.200
Six months later,

32:56.800 --> 32:58.560
I managed to escape first.

33:10.520 --> 33:11.440
Sister.

33:19.400 --> 33:20.240
A Chinese New Year's gift.

33:24.280 --> 33:25.680
Take a look.

33:27.920 --> 33:29.120
It's beautiful.

33:30.800 --> 33:31.640
It must have been expensive.

33:32.280 --> 33:34.800
It didn't cost anything.
Mr. Yao gave it to me.

33:39.560 --> 33:41.480
Happy Chinese New Year, Sister.

33:56.040 --> 33:56.920
He hit you again?

33:59.880 --> 34:02.840
Do you like this gift?

34:10.639 --> 34:11.480
I do.

34:29.560 --> 34:30.920
Happy Chinese New Year,

34:31.440 --> 34:32.440
Sister.

34:36.320 --> 34:37.840
Happy Chinese New Year.

35:39.360 --> 35:41.000
Sister, what's wrong?

35:42.400 --> 35:44.000
Yao is finally gone.

35:44.080 --> 35:46.000
Is there still something
making you unhappy?

35:47.280 --> 35:48.520
I was thinking,

35:50.480 --> 35:51.640
what's going to happen to you?

35:53.440 --> 35:55.880
When will you be able
to get away from the guy?

35:57.800 --> 36:02.080
Meng, why don't you move into my place?

36:04.880 --> 36:07.000
Don't go back to that house anymore.

36:10.600 --> 36:12.240
He's my father.

36:12.880 --> 36:14.600
I've owed him since the day I was born.

36:25.240 --> 36:29.080
I'm not as lucky as you.

36:31.080 --> 36:32.680
An "accident" like that

36:35.600 --> 36:37.600
doesn't happen that easily.

36:46.800 --> 36:48.520
So you didn't know

36:49.160 --> 36:52.520
that Yao Baiyuan
might have been killed by Xu Meng?

36:53.400 --> 36:56.160
At the time, I really thought
it was an accident.

36:56.800 --> 36:58.800
Then, how did Xu Zhihong die?

37:01.920 --> 37:05.840
Xu Meng said it was all for me.

37:15.200 --> 37:17.520
Dad, what are you doing?

37:17.600 --> 37:19.480
Close the door. Hurry up!

37:19.560 --> 37:20.640
Close it!

37:24.240 --> 37:26.440
Leave Weiyang. Pack your things right now.

37:26.520 --> 37:28.720
-We're leaving now.
-But Dad,

37:28.800 --> 37:30.920
why do we have to leave Weiyang?

37:31.000 --> 37:33.160
You ask why? I'll tell you why!

37:33.240 --> 37:37.480
Behind my back,
you took out so many shark loans.

37:37.560 --> 37:39.440
Those people are already at our doorstep.

37:40.080 --> 37:43.280
If we don't leave,
we're just staying here to die?

37:44.360 --> 37:46.560
I'll find a way to pay them back.

37:47.080 --> 37:48.080
Can we please not leave?

37:48.680 --> 37:49.600
Pay them with what?

37:50.120 --> 37:51.520
By selling yourself?

37:51.600 --> 37:54.640
That's enough. Go pack your clothes! Move!

37:54.720 --> 37:56.720
-Go!
-Dad, don't force me.

37:56.800 --> 37:58.600
You won't leave, and I'm "forcing" you?

37:58.680 --> 38:00.200
Is it because of the wretch?

38:01.720 --> 38:04.080
You ungrateful brat!

38:04.680 --> 38:06.880
I'm the one who gave you life.

38:07.520 --> 38:09.680
Go. You're coming with me.

38:10.920 --> 38:12.160
Dad, don't touch that.

38:12.960 --> 38:15.440
Did the wretch give you this outfit?

38:16.560 --> 38:17.600
Dad, don't.

38:17.680 --> 38:18.680
Let go of me.

38:18.760 --> 38:20.360
Let go. Let go!

38:20.960 --> 38:21.960
You won't come with me?

38:22.560 --> 38:24.440
-Are you coming?
-Dad, don't force me.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.280
I'm forcing you?

38:26.360 --> 38:28.640
I'm forcing you?

38:28.720 --> 38:30.520
You don't want to leave?

38:30.600 --> 38:33.520
That's fine. I'll go find
the wretch right now

38:33.600 --> 38:35.160
and beat her to death!

38:35.680 --> 38:37.400
Now, are you coming?

38:57.920 --> 39:00.480
The wretch…

39:00.560 --> 39:03.480
If it weren't for her back then,

39:03.560 --> 39:08.240
I wouldn't have ended up like this.

39:08.320 --> 39:10.280
I'm going to kill her.

39:10.880 --> 39:12.720
I'll kill her…

39:15.720 --> 39:16.840
Medicine…

39:16.920 --> 39:18.640
Medicine… Give it to me.

39:18.720 --> 39:19.960
Medicine…

39:21.600 --> 39:22.680
My medicine.

39:23.920 --> 39:24.840
Quick.

39:25.560 --> 39:27.960
Hurry… Get me my medicine.

39:46.720 --> 39:48.680
PENICILLIN V TABLETS

39:55.360 --> 39:56.680
What happened?

40:34.640 --> 40:35.680
Sister,

40:36.600 --> 40:40.040
when your mom fell off the cliff,
it wasn't an accident.

40:42.040 --> 40:43.760
He was the one who pushed her.

40:53.440 --> 40:55.920
Qing. Qing. Qing, what's wrong?

40:56.000 --> 40:57.040
-Sister.
-Qing.

40:57.120 --> 40:58.400
-You fainted from the cold.
-Sister,

40:58.480 --> 41:00.360
-He tried to take your coat for warmth.
-wake up.

41:01.360 --> 41:02.800
-Qing.
-Sister…

41:04.920 --> 41:06.000
What are you doing?

41:06.680 --> 41:08.080
She's not going to make it anyway.

41:08.160 --> 41:10.080
This coat should be given
to someone who can survive.

41:10.160 --> 41:11.920
What are you talking about?

41:12.000 --> 41:13.480
-Stop it.
-Let go.

41:13.560 --> 41:15.000
-Stop fighting.
-Stay out of this.

41:15.080 --> 41:18.520
Your mom tried to stop him,
so he started wrestling with her.

41:19.280 --> 41:20.240
Dad.

41:20.760 --> 41:21.720
Dad.

41:24.040 --> 41:24.920
Dad.

41:25.920 --> 41:27.120
Dad.

41:27.960 --> 41:29.320
Dad…

41:29.400 --> 41:32.520
Help. Is anyone there? Help.

41:32.600 --> 41:34.920
Help. Is anyone there?

41:35.000 --> 41:36.560
Help.

42:04.360 --> 42:06.680
He thinks his illness is all our fault.

42:07.400 --> 42:09.040
He tortures me every day,

42:09.120 --> 42:10.720
and now he wants to come after you.

42:11.400 --> 42:12.760
I had no other choice.

42:22.760 --> 42:25.080
PEACE AND LUCK TO ALL
WEALTH AND JOY TO HOME

42:49.640 --> 42:50.600
Sister,

42:52.600 --> 42:55.080
from now on, we are real sisters.

42:57.320 --> 42:59.240
I will protect you with my life.

43:21.760 --> 43:26.160
Xu, inside your place,
why is there all that banging?

43:26.240 --> 43:27.640
Is everything all right?

43:27.720 --> 43:30.080
My dad wanted to sell the large wardrobe.

43:30.160 --> 43:32.880
The door is too narrow,
so we couldn't get it out.

43:34.000 --> 43:36.360
So I'm trying to chip at the door frame.

43:39.720 --> 43:42.880
By the way, Uncle Wang, do you have…

43:42.960 --> 43:45.040
Oh, I've got mung bean soup on the stove.

43:45.120 --> 43:46.720
It's about to burn.

43:47.400 --> 43:48.640
It's burning.

44:09.240 --> 44:10.280
Take this

44:11.600 --> 44:12.960
back to my house.

44:16.920 --> 44:18.280
I'll protect you, too.
